# <type>(<scope>): <short summary, imperative, sentence case, no full stop>
#
# Types: feat | fix | chore | docs | refactor | style | build | ci
# Scope: child theme only (uk|au|nz|us|corp|es|eu). Leave blank for the parent theme
# and for anything else: <type>: <summary>
# Keep the first line to 72 characters or less.
# One logical change per commit - don't join several with "fix: ... feat: ...".

# Body (optional): what changed and why, wrapped at 72 characters.
# Mention the module, section, template or child theme affected.

# Footer (optional): breaking changes, issue links.
# BREAKING CHANGE: <what breaks and what to do about it>
# Refs: #123
